Like they found that like 85% of them were fake, and they gave workers the illusion that

1210
00:57:20.940 --> 00:57:24.140
they could control if they were hot and cold, and they found people complained less.

1211
00:57:24.340 --> 00:57:25.260
What the hell?

1212
00:57:25.260 --> 00:57:30.500
And so buildings had like the fake controls in the offices, because then they just didn't

1213
00:57:30.500 --> 00:57:31.900
want to deal with people complaining.

1214
00:57:32.980 --> 00:57:34.040
Nothing is real.

1215
00:57:34.780 --> 00:57:36.100
Nothing is real.

1216
00:57:36.780 --> 00:57:37.680
I don't know.

1217
00:57:38.260 --> 00:57:39.560
Nothing is real.

1218
00:57:39.840 --> 00:57:42.220
Oh my gosh, I'm gonna go live in a cabin in the woods.

1219
00:57:42.440 --> 00:57:45.100
I know our thermostat here at Earwolf works.

1220
